00:51:15.200 --> 00:51:16.200
Harry Potter.

00:51:16.200 --> 00:51:17.479
Hero and adversary.

00:51:17.479 --> 00:51:22.050
And then he’s got his ordinary parents,
and those are the parents that, well they’re

00:51:22.050 --> 00:51:25.009
